<title>DENMARK: Sweden issues 500 mln DKK 4-pct 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden issues 500 mln DKK 4-pct 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Tuesday by arrangers Carnegie Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER - KINGDOM OF SWEDEN.</p>
<p>AMOUNT - 500 MILLION DANISH CROWNS.</p>
<p>COUPON - FOUR PERCENT</p>
<p>MATURITY - NOVEMBER 15, 2005</p>
</text>
